  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Crostata di visciole is built in layers: sour cherry jam first, then a smooth ricotta filling, then pastry lattice. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "crostata"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "crostata"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is baked without blind-baking first, as the jam acts as a moisture barrier. The pastry (pasta frolla) is very short and slightly sweet; it is better pressed into the tin than rolled if the dough feels fragile after chilling."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "items": [
